433
00:31:38,271 --> 00:31:39,815
It's all right, Ye Ji.

434
00:31:56,039 --> 00:31:57,124
Good.

435
00:31:57,791 --> 00:31:58,917
Good, Ye Ji.

436
00:31:59,543 --> 00:32:04,171
You kids just stop worrying and lay low.

437
00:32:04,172 --> 00:32:05,340
Okay?

438
00:32:42,586 --> 00:32:43,753
Do we...

439
00:32:44,421 --> 00:32:46,506
really have to ditch the car too?

440
00:32:47,257 --> 00:32:48,967
We need an alibi.

441
00:32:49,634 --> 00:32:52,553
We will get it back in a few days, so don't worry.

442
00:32:52,554 --> 00:32:53,597
Okay.

443
00:32:54,389 --> 00:32:55,640
Got it.

444
00:34:00,163 --> 00:34:03,083
You're freaking slow.

445
00:34:09,339 --> 00:34:10,382
Darn.

446
00:34:20,225 --> 00:34:21,392
- What... - Darn it.

447
00:34:21,393 --> 00:34:23,436
(Ye Ji's home)

448
00:34:24,396 --> 00:34:25,397
My gosh.

449
00:34:28,817 --> 00:34:31,570
- Jeez. - I thought you were the master of shoveling in the army.

450
00:34:33,280 --> 00:34:35,406
The weather is still cold,

451
00:34:35,407 --> 00:34:37,075
so the ground hasn't thawed yet.

452
00:35:02,767 --> 00:35:04,185
Step aside.

453
00:35:23,496 --> 00:35:25,039
Min Seo.

454
00:35:25,040 --> 00:35:26,665
There's something...

455
00:35:26,666 --> 00:35:29,586
I don't understand.

456
00:35:31,504 --> 00:35:35,967
Why did Ye Ji hide you in the first place?

457
00:35:50,440 --> 00:35:52,941
I get that you kids are close friends,

458
00:35:52,942 --> 00:35:55,445
