459
00:35:57,822 --> 00:36:01,493
Is there some other issue that you're keeping from me?

460
00:36:02,827 --> 00:36:05,246
No, that's not it.

461
00:36:06,039 --> 00:36:08,165
I'm just asking...

462
00:36:08,166 --> 00:36:10,752
in case there's something I can do to help.

463
00:36:12,712 --> 00:36:15,090
I'm sorry for letting you down.

464
00:36:22,180 --> 00:36:24,265
I'm always on your side.

465
00:36:24,724 --> 00:36:27,017
You can tell me anything.

466
00:36:27,018 --> 00:36:28,019
You know that, right?

467
00:36:39,781 --> 00:36:42,158
Everything is going to be fine. Don't worry.

468
00:36:43,576 --> 00:36:45,036
It's going to be okay.

469
00:36:49,582 --> 00:36:50,917
We can't just...

470
00:36:51,710 --> 00:36:53,211
toss him...

471
00:36:53,837 --> 00:36:55,212
in here,

472
00:36:55,213 --> 00:36:56,923
- can we? - What do you think?

473
00:37:00,218 --> 00:37:02,636
- Push him gently. - Be careful.

474
00:37:02,637 --> 00:37:04,513
- He's too heavy. - Wait.

475
00:37:04,514 --> 00:37:06,765
This guy is too heavy!

476
00:37:06,766 --> 00:37:08,642
Wait, babe. Do it gently.

477
00:37:08,643 --> 00:37:10,437
Honey, he's too heavy!

478
00:37:12,731 --> 00:37:13,857
My arms are killing me.

479
00:37:14,482 --> 00:37:17,110
This is nothing like kneading dough.

480
00:37:17,819 --> 00:37:19,612
It's exhausting.

481
00:37:20,405 --> 00:37:22,449
Hurry up before it hardens.

482
00:37:25,160 --> 00:37:27,829
Goodness, I'm truly sorry.

483
00:37:38,131 --> 00:37:39,257
Honey.

484
00:37:40,341 --> 00:37:42,302
We don't have any more cement, do we?

485
00:37:44,304 --> 00:37:45,597
Come on.

486
00:37:46,222 --> 00:37:47,599
Why couldn't you...

487
00:37:48,099 --> 00:37:49,768
You should've spread it out evenly.

488
00:37:51,478 --> 00:37:54,272
This should be enough.

489
00:37:55,607 --> 00:37:57,567
This man is just too big.

490
00:38:20,131 --> 00:38:22,258
We might get punished for this, babe.

491
00:38:24,636 --> 00:38:26,303
Right now,

492
00:38:26,304 --> 00:38:27,972
