493
00:38:37,607 --> 00:38:38,650
Hong.

494
00:38:40,151 --> 00:38:42,028
We didn't miss anything, right?

495
00:38:44,072 --> 00:38:45,740
That's a shantytown.

496
00:38:46,449 --> 00:38:48,076
There are absolutely...

497
00:38:48,576 --> 00:38:50,328
no security cameras.

498
00:38:57,252 --> 00:39:00,420
Still, shouldn't we at least find out who he is?

499
00:39:00,421 --> 00:39:02,881
What if someone comes looking for him?

500
00:39:02,882 --> 00:39:04,175
What difference...

501
00:39:04,843 --> 00:39:06,553
would it make now?

502
00:39:08,471 --> 00:39:09,597
Babe.

503
00:39:13,768 --> 00:39:15,562
We're past the point of no return.

504
00:39:32,996 --> 00:39:33,997
Hong.

505
00:39:34,873 --> 00:39:36,915
Where's the memory card?

506
00:39:36,916 --> 00:39:37,959
What?

507
00:39:41,129 --> 00:39:43,547
I pulled the entire thing out.

508
00:39:43,548 --> 00:39:44,757
Is it missing?

509
00:39:46,342 --> 00:39:47,635
Oh, maybe...

510
00:39:48,177 --> 00:39:49,721
Ye Ji took it.

511
00:39:51,306 --> 00:39:52,599
Ye Ji...

512
00:39:53,892 --> 00:39:55,894
tampered with the dashcam too?

513
00:40:03,776 --> 00:40:05,361
It's burning well.

514
00:40:11,409 --> 00:40:13,953
What do we do with the phone and wallet?

515
00:40:14,913 --> 00:40:16,073
We'd better burn them, right?

516
00:40:17,332 --> 00:40:18,374
- You're crazy. - What?

517
00:40:18,917 --> 00:40:20,543
The phone will explode.

518
00:40:21,252 --> 00:40:24,088
And don't ever turn the power on.

519
00:40:26,841 --> 00:40:29,802
Our Father in heaven.

520
00:40:32,096 --> 00:40:35,308
Give us our daily bread.

521
00:40:35,934 --> 00:40:39,311
Forgive us our trespasses.

522
00:40:39,312 --> 00:40:40,438
And...

523
00:40:42,941 --> 00:40:44,233
May he...

524
00:40:46,069 --> 00:40:48,321
rest in peace.

525
00:40:50,657 --> 00:40:51,658
Amen.

526
00:40:54,535 --> 00:40:55,745
Amen.

527
00:41:09,092 --> 00:41:11,970
We'd better pay off the mortgage on the villa first.

528
00:41:27,360 --> 00:41:28,695
Why on earth did you!

529
00:41:30,071 --> 00:41:31,447
What were you thinking...

530
00:41:36,577 --> 00:41:38,162
I'm sorry.

531
00:41:46,337 --> 00:41:47,547
Ye Ji.

532
00:41:48,381 --> 00:41:50,382
Don't ever tell anyone...

533
00:41:50,383 --> 00:41:52,927
about what happened today.

534
00:41:53,845 --> 00:41:55,513
You hear me?

535
00:41:56,848 --> 00:41:57,890
Yes.

536
00:41:59,475 --> 00:42:00,601
Good.

537
00:42:01,310 --> 00:42:02,603
Lim Ye Ji.

538
00:42:06,024 --> 00:42:07,984
If you ever do something like this again,

539
00:42:08,943 --> 00:42:11,988
I'll drag you to the police station myself.

540
00:42:12,405 --> 00:42:13,614
Got it?

541
00:42:15,199 --> 00:42:16,284
Yes.

542
00:42:17,827 --> 00:42:19,203
I'm sorry.

543
00:42:20,913 --> 00:42:22,373
I'll never do it again.

544
00:42:36,721 --> 00:42:38,347
Are we going to be okay?

545
00:42:41,434 --> 00:42:44,145
We made sure of everything.

546
00:42:47,774 --> 00:42:49,734
We ditched the car,

547
00:42:51,360 --> 00:42:52,987
and the body...

548
00:42:55,114 --> 00:42:56,908
We took good care...

549
00:42:57,366 --> 00:42:58,701
of that guy too.

550
00:43:01,412 --> 00:43:03,955
And that land belongs to us.

551
00:43:03,956 --> 00:43:06,542
As long as we never sell it...

552
00:43:08,795 --> 00:43:10,254
I'm talking about Ye Ji.

553
00:43:14,258 --> 00:43:16,594
Do you think we failed as parents?

554
00:43:24,143 --> 00:43:26,938
I'm not sure if this is really okay.

555
00:43:28,815 --> 00:43:30,315
It is.

556
00:43:30,316 --> 00:43:32,026
It will be okay.

557
00:43:35,488 --> 00:43:36,739
Right.

558
00:43:38,407 --> 00:43:40,576
- It has to be okay. - Yes.

559
00:43:41,410 --> 00:43:42,954
It's going to be all right.

560
00:43:43,538 --> 00:43:45,247
It has to be okay.

561
00:43:45,248 --> 00:43:46,374
Yes.

562
00:43:47,458 --> 00:43:50,294
It'll be okay. It has to be.

563
00:43:52,755 --> 00:43:54,549
It will be okay, right?

564
00:43:55,842 --> 00:43:57,343
It will be.

565
00:43:58,344 --> 00:44:00,303
It has to be okay.

566
